# REQUIRES: python-api, hdf5, cuda
# Drawn velocities and typed restraints in the Python model on a GPU
# (D198), scenario nvt-double-restraints of
# Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py. The effect of the restraints and
# of a moved reference on the NVT energies at step 10 in double precision;
# the run with the default reference, which scenario nvt-double compares
# with `mdir run`, is computed again here as a reference only.
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir -p %t
# RUN: %mdir_python %S/Inputs/python_velocities_restraints.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide GPU mdir mdir-model-test %t nvt-double-restraints | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: NVT: the restraints change the potential
# CHECK: velocities and restraints nvt-double-restraints passed
